\[
\gcd(m,n) \times \mathop{\text{lcm}}[m,n] = m \times n
\]

Given that \(\gcd(m,n) = 2\) and \(\mathop{\text{lcm}}[m,n] = 108\), we can express \(m\) and \(n\) as:

