## Perspective 2: Mathematical Solution

### Problem Restatement
We have a true-false test consisting of 100 items. Every question that is a multiple of 4 is marked as true, while all other questions are marked as false. A student marks every question that is a multiple of 3 as false and all others as true. We need to find out how many items the student will answer correctly.

### Mathematical Concepts Involved
