   - For \( k = 2 \): \( \left\lfloor \frac{942}{9} \right\rfloor = 104 \)
   - For \( k = 3 \): \( \left\lfloor \frac{942}{27} \right\rfloor = 34 \)
   - For \( k = 4 \): \( \left\lfloor \frac{942}{81} \right\rfloor = 11 \)
   - For \( k = 5 \): \( \left\lfloor \frac{942}{243} \right\rfloor = 3 \)
