   From \( t = -t \cdot \frac{180}{\pi} + 2k\pi \):
   \[
   t + t \cdot \frac{180}{\pi} = 2k\pi
   \]
   \[
   t\left(1 + \frac{180}{\pi}\right) = 2k\pi
   \]
