     - Point \( \mathbf{p_1} = \begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ -10 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \)
     - Direction \( \mathbf{d_1} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -9 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} \)
   - For Line 2:
     - Point \( \mathbf{p_2} = \begin{pmatrix} -5 \\ -3 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix} \)
     - Direction \( \mathbf{d_2} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ -18 \\ -4 \end{pmatrix} \)

