- For \( n = 1 \): \( D_1 = 10 \)
- For \( n = 2 \): \( D_2 = 10 \cdot 10 - 3 \cdot 3 = 100 - 9 = 91 \)
- For \( n \geq 3 \): The determinant can be computed using the formula:
